@startuml
title DNAT - Etapa 6
caption O processo de build surge como ponto provavel de falha por executar codigo externo e dependencias nao confiaveis

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #14324A
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam roundcorner 18
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #355C7D
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 140

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4B6584
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #577590
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #577590
  FontColor #14324A
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #F5F7FA
  BorderColor #829AB1
  FontColor #243B53
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7D6
  BorderColor #D4B85F
  FontColor #5C4813
}
skinparam rectangle<<mainvm>> {
  BackgroundColor #EAF4FF
  BorderColor #2F6FB5
  FontColor #113A63
}
skinparam rectangle<<buildvm>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF1E6
  BorderColor #D97706
  FontColor #7C3E0A
}
skinparam rectangle<<microvm>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF2
  BorderColor #C0A000
  FontColor #6E5A00
}
skinparam database<<secret>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8ECFF
  BorderColor #5B6EE1
  FontColor #263A99
}

cloud "Internet / indices de pacotes" as NET

rectangle "CVM principal" <<mainvm>> as MAIN {
  component "Frontend + API" as FE
  database "Dados sensiveis" <<secret>> as SEC
}

rectangle "CVM builder" <<buildvm>> as BUILD {
  component "API de build" as API
  component "worker efemero" as WORK
  rectangle "microVM de build" <<microvm>> as B
}

FE --> API : source + manifest
API --> WORK : prepara build
WORK --> B : sobe guest
B --> NET : baixa dependencias
B -[#C73E1D,dashed,thickness=2]-> WORK : codigo externo\nou dependencias maliciosas

note bottom of BUILD
O build processa codigo do usuario e software externo antes da aplicacao ser promovida.
Por isso, ele vira um novo ponto de atencao.
end note

@enduml
